{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1000_p", "source_sha256": "9744338128a4ee8497d1f56897b25b0b5064284d9862a1e4f67b5833df815b58", "ja": "（今日は美奈子の撮影だが……\nしかし夏とはいえ、今日は特に暑いな）", "zh": "（今天美奈子要拍戏……\n虽说是夏天，不过今天特别热呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "0bda25a5ed67759c75f1904801746b9d250653fcad7afa98152378e0e06b38ee", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　体調はどうですか？\nのどが渇いたら、夏バテ防止のドリンクがありますよ！", "zh": "{$P$}先生！你身体状况还好吗？\n如果渴了的话，有防止中暑的饮料喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "92e5c1d478ca7832efce59c9a9b086c3cf63ded188bb1ad9388ebcf6cab1d7e7", "ja": "それからえーと、塩レモンと、冷やした栄養ゼリーと、\nあとは……そうそう、特製の梅干しも！", "zh": "然后还有，呃～盐渍柠檬、事先冰好的营养冻饮跟……\n对了对了，还有特制酸梅！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "8aebb94044beceefe20efd151e81afbd811ce7d5274f4afb1941c36573cdaccd", "ja": "たくさんあるので、遠慮なく食べちゃってくださいね♪\nお腹が空いたら、おにぎりもありますよ！", "zh": "我准备了很多，不用客气尽管吃吧♪\n要是肚子饿了，还有饭团喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2f145cf5dfc73d72a44bd9e6238ff23056bdea0dbad1b446c060dea365d45a88", "ja": "おお、ありがとう！　スポーツドリンクは\n用意してきたんだけど、こうも暑いとな……。", "zh": "哦哦，谢谢！我是准备了运动饮料过来，\n但没想到热成这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "38afe5d7d17aa7f4fb412a2383f44a3b3ff14320fb9a6c2b765563787f1eb5c1", "ja": "気にしないでください♪\n私が好きでやってることですから。", "zh": "别在意♪\n是我自己想做的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "3bebfb7f850997c7627e07062eb4f5a7d5e15f86d99e0cdfe4ee5505b428238d", "ja": "あ、そうだ。今日の帰りはうちに寄って、\nスタミナ料理を食べていってください！", "zh": "啊，对了，今天回去时顺便来我家，\n吃点补充体力的料理再走吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1007_019min", "source_sha256": "0c7317b1cf1e944860bfd9574bad22e2994138b0c264ca9e69289ab9d1bd572f", "ja": "夏こそ、暑さを乗り切るためにも、栄養たっぷりで\nバランスのとれた食事が大事なんですよ！", "zh": "夏天更应该摄取营养丰富又均衡的饮食，\n才能够熬过炎热的天气喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1008_p", "source_sha256": "0cdca9909189eae5887402eb83ad5601ed786ee17f8e6bc66a705bbc9a327b1f", "ja": "そうだな。仕事が終わったらみんなで……\nあれ？　向こうが騒がしいな……。", "zh": "说得也是，那就工作结束后大家一起……\n奇怪？那边有点吵闹……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "339b45e0d4d571b071d92059ca120b3f45656214ee4da2a125561616c79b5386", "ja": "スタッフさんが慌ててるみたいです。\n何か、あったんでしょうか？", "zh": "工作人员好像很慌张的样子。\n发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1010_p", "source_sha256": "d7b45551a7cdb747759f18f18c89b3ca215f79a4adc248ff9ae945a376bc811a", "ja": "すまない、美奈子。今日の撮影が中止になるかも\nしれないそうだ。おにぎりが届かないらしい。", "zh": "抱歉，美奈子。\n今天的拍摄可能要中止了，好像是饭团没有送来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "7183c4471f7e17c8ef50857b8fddf4d23ab925ac758b0c3adf4919eafcf6fc4c", "ja": "えっ？　おにぎりって、撮影で\n美希ちゃんが食べるおにぎりですか？", "zh": "咦？你说饭团，\n是美希拍戏要吃的饭团吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b554cbaa3d5ffc862c0aebc5dde572ecfe2da1acb0f5b9f94951ab11323e46b7", "ja": "ああ、話の都合上おにぎりは外せないからな。\nないと撮影ができないし。美奈子には悪いけど……。", "zh": "是的，碍于剧情关系，饭团不可或缺，\n没有的话就拍不成了。虽然对美奈子很不好意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "1653a7b280ec77a3931714d485f6fe56a95d088a32928122f9985428baac8e9d", "ja": "何言ってるんですか、{$P$}さんっ！\nこういう時こそ、私の出番ですよ！", "zh": "你在说什么呢，{$P$}先生！\n这种时候才更需要我出场啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1014_p", "source_sha256": "96624151442852b264ade8f31df13357a88317ebb025d2ae97f5a832824bb824", "ja": "美奈子に任せるって……あ！\nそうか、おにぎり……。", "zh": "交给美奈子的意思是……\n啊！对喔，饭团……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "071a848ef43373208d0129573527a4e747a0dddc7f8ea7ecfa346608c7d128c4", "ja": "はい！　こんなこともあろうかと、今日の\nお弁当に、おにぎりを握ってきましたから！", "zh": "没错！我想过可能会出现意外状况，\n所以今天的便当就自己捏了饭团带过来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1016_p", "source_sha256": "58b7d963d0e11dde3c7adfb37600a05b151cac8fe648bb1972716baac53096e0", "ja": "すごいな、美奈子！\n偶然とはいえ……。", "zh": "太厉害了，美奈子！\n虽说是碰巧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "8fef5c31fb96b176c3a4fde537e954b10f6108c951acd467986fa04c1a44e021", "ja": "いいえ、偶然じゃないんですよ！　このおにぎり、\n美希ちゃんに食べてもらおうと思ってましたから！", "zh": "不，这可不是碰巧喔！\n是因为我想请美希吃这个饭团！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "c3de4ba5e3eaec31e4d919c52abc2558456f6c116e997d50ed76cbc035ce48e9", "ja": "私の役って、妖狐のミキとおにぎりを通じて\n仲良くなって、それから一緒に戦うじゃないですか。", "zh": "我的角色会透过饭团跟妖狐美希变得要好，\n然后一起并肩作战，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "8c4dcf9ff62ab37e13d82e8918234cccde5832fce9bef5c7cb56c7583eda3232", "ja": "おにぎりで結ばれた友情っていいな～と思って、\nマネして握ってきてみたんです♪", "zh": "我觉得用饭团牵起的友情很棒～\n于是就试着学剧中捏了饭团♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1020_p", "source_sha256": "685e9354fc1969e42e3dbc3c66d1b57e02033814d56aaf61d51cd0810c6a496d", "ja": "そうだったのか。よし、さっそく\nスタッフさんに話をしてみよう。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。\n好，我这就去跟工作人员谈谈看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "88ce3068f9d5940a2aead42bf7856cf5fc15e72914f061a03aaf6562882d1232", "ja": "はいっ、まかせてください！　佐竹飯店特製おにぎり、\n暑さで傷まないよう、対策もバッチリですから！", "zh": "好的！包在我身上！佐竹饭店特制饭团，\n为了避免因气温炎热而腐坏，也早有万全对策！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "d160eaa774a4f793a5254762b2b6e2e6b6b56513447d05ddc85bf4f915698678", "ja": "具は塩鮭と、昆布と、梅干し。ラップで握って、\n海苔はあとから巻けるようにしてあります♪", "zh": "馅料是盐渍鲑鱼、昆布跟酸梅，裹着保鲜膜捏制，\n海苔则是之后再包上去♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0124_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0124_1023_p", "source_sha256": "21d50101f6922fc8fa317cd46ec8a47ad5ff41d674fe8e99ad9fed8f55325e93", "ja": "（その後、美奈子が持ってきたおにぎりのおかげで、\n撮影は進んだ。美希とも仲良くなれて、よかったな！）", "zh": "（多亏美奈子带来的饭团，拍摄顺利进行了。\n她也跟美希变得很要好，真是太好了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
